+	 * eSE at power state 0x3B (the vendor OFFHOST_AID_ROUTE_PWR_STATE):
+	 *
+	 *   1) NFC-A technology  -> eSE  @ 0x3B
+	 *   2) MIFARE  (0x80)    -> eSE  @ 0x3B
+	 *   3) ISO-DEP (0x04)    -> eSE  @ 0x3B
+	 *
+	 * The NFC-F technology and NFC-DEP protocol entries a previous revision
