+		 * runs after RF_DISCOVER_MAP and before NFCEE_POWER_AND_LINK_CTRL
+		 * and the LMRT, per the canonical NCI order. The S3FWRN5 may
+		 * answer a redundant MODE_SET on an already-enabled NFCEE with
+		 * status 0x03 (REJECTED); that is NOT fatal -- log it and
